ugabyte-db/issues/13846","id":1251991127,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc5Kn95X","user":{"login":"def-","id":2335377,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzUzNzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2335377?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/def-","html_url":"https://github.com/def-","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/def-/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/def-/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/def-/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/def-/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/def-/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/def-/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/def-/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/def-/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/def-/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-09-20T08:06:40Z","updated_at":"2022-09-20T08:09:52Z","body":"Gflags:\r\n```\r\nTserver: {\"enable_stream_compression\": true, \"stream_compression_algo\": 1, \"enable_automatic_tablet_splitting\": true, \"ysql_num_shards_per_tserver\": 1, \"yb_num_shards_per_tserver\": 1, \"ysql_enable_packed_row\": true, \"ycql_enable_packed_row\": true, \"db_write_buffer_size\": 102400}\r\nMaster: {\"enable_stream_compression\": true, \"tablet_split_low_phase_size_threshold_bytes\": 25600000, \"stream_compression_algo\": 1, \"enable_automatic_tablet_splitting\": true, \"tablet_split_low_phase_shard_count_per_node\": 16, \"tablet_split_high_phase_shard_count_per_node\": 10000, \"tablet_split_low_phase_size_threshold_bytes\": 1048576, \"tablet_split_high_phase_size_threshold_bytes\": 10485760, \"ysql_enable_packed_row\": true, \"ycql_enable_packed_row\": true, \"db_write_buffer_size\": 102400}\r\n```\r\nThe workloads I was running were\r\n```\r\nnm/s1-columns $ips puppy-food-arm-1-s1 --username yugabyte --password $pw\r\nnm/c2 $ips puppy-food-arm-1-c2 --ssl_cert nm/puppy-food-arm-1-ycql.crt --username cassandra --password $pw\r\nnm/s4-columns $ips puppy-food-arm-1-s4 --username yugabyte --password $pw --num_unique_keys 1000000\r\nnm/c4-columns $ips puppy-food-arm-1-c4 --ssl_cert nm/puppy-food-arm-1-ycql.crt --username cassandra --password $pw --num_unique_keys 1000\r\n```\r\nwith sample apps 1.8.8 from https://github.com/yugabyte/yb-stress-test/releases\r\n```\r\n[centos@ip ~]$ cat nm/s1-columns\r\nnohup /usr/lib/jvm/java-11-openjdk-11.0.15.0.9-2.el7_9.x86_64/bin/java -jar yb-sample-apps.jar --workload SqlSecondaryIndex --nodes $1  --num_threads_read 1 --num_threads_write 1 --num_unique_keys 1000000000 --num_value_columns 1500 --nouuid \"${@:3}\" >& $2.log &\r\n[centos@ip ~]$ cat nm/c2\r\nnohup /usr/lib/jvm/java-11-openjdk-11.0.15.0.9-2.el7_9.x86_64/bin/java -jar yb-sample-apps.jar --workload CassandraUniqueSecondaryIndex  --nodes $1  --num_threads_read 1 --num_threads_write 1 --num_unique_keys 1000000000 --nouuid \"${@:3}\" >& $2.log &\r\n[centos@ip ~]$ cat nm/c4-columns\r\nnohup /usr/lib/jvm/java-11-openjdk-11.0.15.0.9-2.el7_9.x86_64/bin/java -jar yb-sample-apps-1.8.8.jar --workload CassandraDataLoad --nouuid --nodes $1 --num_threads_read 1 --num_threads_write 1 --num_writes -1 --num_reads -1 --num_value_columns 3000 --num_indexes 5 --batch_size 1 --large_value_multiplier 15 --large_key_multiplier 15 --use_datatypes true \"${@:3}\" >& $2.log &\r\n[centos@ip ~]$ cat nm/s4-columns\r\nnohup /usr/lib/jvm/java-11-openjdk-11.0.15.0.9-2.el7_9.x86_64/bin/java -jar yb-sample-apps-1.8.8.jar --workload SqlDataLoad --use_datatypes true --nodes $1  --num_threads_read 1 --num_threads_write 1 --num_value_columns 1500 --nouuid \"${@:3}\" >& $2.log &\r\n```\r\nAfter these workloads running for a while I ran a YCQL backup with 10 threads 2 x until this failure occurred.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/12519